                <l xml:id="m-fdf1a69c-272a-4018-8c31-492d64f9b8e9" facs="#m-ae6d789e-54d0-4b2d-b421-7e8b81b3646f" label="text-like">sth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-df9fab4a-251e-43f4-b1af-57bc3dcff24f" facs="#m-edd61bfa-b093-4c5f-b6ac-c6072f0cc05e" label="ambiguous">ioia</l><l xml:id="m-8606e0bd-fec3-42a6-93cc-3842af2f1704" facs="#m-0024bee6-9e18-444a-bddf-51215df64ced" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-fb502629-3444-4834-a427-b81a4fd8f7ad" facs="#m-d8a1ff7f-23c7-4462-891f-f82a7890a8e7" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-2f6c4fbc-33a9-48f7-89df-04a5188ce79c" facs="#m-e624e949-1a04-4294-8b9b-5f65fdc1e77d" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.D</l><l xml:id="m-8ad90986-a171-48f4-bce3-dbbac18e38b8" facs="#m-53058fa7-6632-4af2-b3f5-17449555ebf2" label="lyrics-like">ON pótest“ árbor bóna frúctus má-los fáce¬</l><l xml:id="m-88df601d-fbdc-44a2-bf5e-5312591de628" facs="#m-c260509b-48df-4da4-8bce-71599bcca781" label="lyrics-like">re, neque árbor má-la frúctus bónos fá-ce-re: ómnis</l><l xml:id="m-a6650741-5f1b-4747-982c-251ad89dd7ed" facs="#m-30a5c806-a48c-46c3-9a6c-862f7220bacd" label="lyrics-like">árbor quae non fá-cit frúctum bónum, excidé-tur, et in</l><l xml:id="m-30c906fc-2958-4a21-a0ad-ae24705dd14b" facs="#m-8b32fb70-1f2f-4741-a878-a25333a79641" label="lyrics-like">ignem mit-té-tur, alle-lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-0a5103ac-4dd8-4db4-a77e-f4a8c888be6f" facs="#m-63483108-73b6-465e-a368-facce20a7fe4" label="lyrics-like">cant. Magníficat. I. D. p. 207. Prayer. Deus, cujus providéntia. p. 1010.</l><l xml:id="m-0c324366-79cd-448a-b0dd-bcba2638b7ca" facs="#m-0827157f-98f4-47ab-a2a6-4b69c9e5bc98" label="text-like">The Eighth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-f687e9be-ba1b-49ae-bf92-4d915c1d56c8" facs="#m-fcd45041-2b1c-4713-ac2e-3144e93f7abc" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-1cbda4b2-db28-44df-9db5-19a6db816f94" facs="#m-2df0be97-fd18-4da0-9b79-5706ea5130c4" label="lyrics-like">Introit. Suscépimus Deus. as on the feasts of the Purification of the</l><l xml:id="m-b9abca9e-44e6-41cf-b665-040b05d0dcd4" facs="#m-083cdd8c-cff2-4686-92d0-a0c769a841ce" label="ambiguous">Blessed Virgin Mary, Feb. 2nd. p. 1361.</l><l xml:id="m-8b80dcba-300a-423d-8865-e3b111f4cfdc" facs="#m-f34ba4e9-f584-47d7-ac11-947f01374ba9" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-49b7d93b-b4f5-4848-b20b-f5248fc1fd6d" facs="#m-515cd46d-6574-4255-be31-e0a2c7ba64d5" label="lyrics-like">Argíre nobis, quaésumus Dómi-]di :t ut qui sine te esse non póssu¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e7b57ca-f88c-43b3-a83e-722525852c31" facs="#m-736507c2-80c4-42b6-82d1-7d0151a6fc48" label="lyrics-like">Il ne, semper spíritum cogitándil mus, * secúndum te vivere valeá¬</l><l xml:id="m-3479cea1-759c-415f-b7ed-bdd834e9f1b5" facs="#m-5809f852-ec0b-4241-aa8e-0fc20e3bd550" label="lyrics-like">quae recta sunt, propítius, et agén- mus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3698c3aa-3971-4533-aead-81cd73f3815a" facs="#m-b1b802cd-6845-4fcb-94e9-02e0e3f1cb76" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-d16f5509-bd74-4128-a9e6-51d68f9feed7" facs="#m-21755e00-bf67-433f-bbea-7f285ba14fd8" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Romanos. Rom. S. c.</l><l xml:id="m-7252d729-c1a6-403d-a85b-d3c0ad7712ae" facs="#m-6ccebd9c-173e-4440-a0a6-b05e0d51bac3" label="lyrics-like">Ratres: Debitóres sumus non ¡íterum in timóre, sed accepístis spí¬</l><l xml:id="m-af3a1164-94b5-48d8-972e-20a33428e994" facs="#m-055fc66d-0c3a-41a2-b657-623e85dd5842" label="lyrics-like">carni, ut secúndum carnem vi-ritum adoptiónis filiórum, in quo</l><l xml:id="m-373b08a0-29a7-49d8-9335-92f4ce8d1c51" facs="#m-a302ddcd-8348-47a3-9210-0065e7045fc8" label="lyrics-like">clamámus: Abba (Pater). Ipse enim</l><l xml:id="m-7330b4e8-9086-41ea-b449-798e1701dae6" facs="#m-3364b8b6-50b4-42ae-aa68-28999d8ab0ba" label="lyrics-like">vámus. Si enim secúndum carnem</l><l xml:id="m-861b3901-a8ca-4c04-9f96-6dd292e41739" facs="#m-eab75f62-144f-4201-bf19-4913f7469f74" label="lyrics-like">Spíritus testimónium reddit spiritui</l><l xml:id="m-a2ca4ab1-c80b-40d8-85bb-d18bd69dd409" facs="#m-a50a07ff-0419-4795-bc5a-7fc9cb636bd2" label="lyrics-like">vixéritis, moriémini: si autem spí¬</l><l xml:id="m-97b55f31-45d8-44e2-9aea-0bad537f592d" facs="#m-054d434d-2557-48d9-b7a1-6522106e3dcf" label="lyrics-like">ritu facta carnis mortificavéritis,</l><l xml:id="m-3ccc58e0-368a-43dd-be29-0770cabbadc1" facs="#m-00d9e7bd-5eda-482a-8923-0939a6997900" label="ambiguous">nostro, quod sumus filii Dei. Si au¬</l><l xml:id="m-29b74733-25e1-48e1-a329-ce4b57b88056" facs="#m-383d1112-56cf-4f7e-b56c-4ed446f7d468" label="lyrics-like">vivétis. Quicúmque enim spíritu</l><l xml:id="m-eee45ddd-7ffb-4134-9559-f56fa80d9a71" facs="#m-67612ce7-e4ac-4cd0-8b0f-825b9629bf00" label="lyrics-like">tem filii, et haerédes: haerédes qui¬</l><l xml:id="m-83c20a7f-8000-45be-9ceb-b5f9211a55d9" facs="#m-52992ecd-9869-4061-8233-fd7e9a0b8dc4" label="lyrics-like">Dei agúntur, ii sunt filii Dei- Non dem Dei, cohaerédes autem Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-499dc992-0db5-41a2-ae1c-cec44e314925" facs="#m-3afa700a-5dae-4528-a922-ec78bf39496a" label="lyrics-like">enim accepistis spiritum servitútis</l><l xml:id="m-e3c89e24-8670-43ef-9f59-215e2eb66709" facs="#m-7a270c53-6e79-4de2-9d47-247fbcb54ae3" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-6bce6abd-0a4f-44fc-83df-a50f500dc699" facs="#m-7d1f6fa3-81b1-4738-9f0a-cab60fda7985" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-80dbbb7a-8658-4b38-ad9f-e6d37b5dcbe0" facs="#m-9f007f52-ec75-43b4-9273-ec50f0b6d55a" label="lyrics-like">-sto míhi “in Dé- um pro¬ te¬</l><l xml:id="m-aca4df0d-deb0-48d5-af67-b02986164aa0" facs="#m-ee13f113-4fa8-460f-ab5b-f3b9f3353692" label="lyrics-like">ctó- rem,</l><l xml:id="m-670eff18-fa15-4fc0-a027-d6c9b40ab3fc" facs="#m-6826e4d7-8541-4149-be8d-84781ae27427" label="ambiguous">M</l></lg>
